This is a DLL mod that allows you to adjust how often enemies drop their items and how many materials you get from each pickup, so you spend less time farming and more time actually playing.

Drop rates can be set in one of two ways: multiply every item's drop chance by a number you choose, or give every item the same fixed drop chance. Materials have their own multipliers for crafting materials, upgrade materials, and materials that can only be picked up once.

[size=4][b][color=#C0860A]F[/color][color=#CF9F31]e[/color][color=#DFB858]a[/color][color=#EED17F]t[/color][color=#EED17F]u[/color][color=#DFB858]r[/color][color=#CF9F31]e[/color][color=#C0860A]s[/color][/b][/size]
[list]
[*]Multiply every enemy drop's chance by a configurable factor, or force it to a fixed percent instead - your choice preserves each item's share relative to its drop-table row-mates.[/*]
[*]Multiply how many crafting and upgrade materials you get, with a separate multiplier for materials that can only be picked up once.[/*]
[*]Hotkey to reload the ini without restarting the game.[/*]
[/list]

This mod edits the base drop rate; Discovery stat/gear still apply on top, same as vanilla. 
[b]Note:[/b] The fixed-percent option can turn an already-guaranteed (100%) drop into a chance-based one.

